g if necessary.\n\nNote: The PATIENT domain agent returned an error due to empty SQL data, so no recommendations are provided for this domain.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Which drugs are expiring in the next 30 days and which of those need an urgent reorder right now?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '**Unified Risk Dashboard**\n==========================\n\n### **PHARMACY**\n\n#### Most Critical Finding:\n* **Amlodipine 5mg**, **Folic Acid 5mg**, and **Cisplatin 50mg** are expiring in 30 days with a critical urgency level.\n\n| Drug Name | Expiry Date | Days Until Expiry | Urgency |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Amlodipine 5mg | 2026-05-03 | 30 | Critical |\n| Folic Acid 5mg | 2026-05-03 | 30 | Critical |\n| Cisplatin 50mg | 2026-05-02 | 31 | Critical |\n\n### **BILLING**\n\n#### No findings to report.\n\n### **RECOMMENDED ACTIONS**\n\nBased on the unified risk dashboard, the top 3 most urgent items across all domains are:\n\n1. **Urgent Reorder**: Amlodipine 5mg and Folic Acid 5mg need an immediate reorder due to their critical urgency level and impending expiry date.\n2. **Near-term Expiry**: Cisplatin 50mg is expiring in 31 days with a critical urgency level, requiring close monitoring and potential reordering soon.\n3. **Medium-term Expiry**: Azithromycin 250mg (multiple batches) has multiple expiries within the next few weeks, necessitating regular stock checks to avoid stockouts.\n\nThese recommended actions will help mitigate risks associated with expired medications and ensure a stable supply chain for patient care.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Show me all Critical HIPAA violations logged in the last 30 days, classify each by regulation section, and recommend a resolution action for each.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '**Critical HIPAA Violations**\n\nWe have identified several critical HIPAA violations that occurred within the last 30 days.\n\n| Process | Regulation Section | Description | Status |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ICU Transfer