G context, claims for surgical procedures must include applicable HCPCS modifiers. Failure to append Modifier -25 is one of the most common causes of claim rejection.\n\n### Recommended Action\nReview and update billing practices for CPT codes **99214** and **99285**, focusing on accurate coding and modifier application to reduce rejection rates. Additionally, ensure that all claims for surgical procedures include applicable HCPCS modifiers to avoid rejections.\n</chat_history>'}], 'stream': False}
