otice to minimize financial loss.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Which insurance company has the highest count of rejected claims right now, and what is our total financial loss from those rejections compared to approved claims?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': ''}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Which insurance company has the highest count of rejected claims right now, and what is our total financial loss from those rejections compared to approved claims?'}]}
